{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19921","headline":"靖安寄居 · 孟郊","name":"靖安寄居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寄静不寄华，爱兹嵽嵲居。\n渴饮浊清泉，饥食无名蔬。\n败菜不敢火，补衣亦写书。\n古云俭成德，今乃实起予。\n戆叟戆不足，贤人贤有余。\n役生皆促促，心竟谁舒舒。\n万马踏风衢，衆尘随犇车。\n高宾尽不见，大道夜方虚。\n卧有洞庭梦，坐无长安储。\n英髦空骇耳，烟火独微如。\n厚念恐伤性，薄田忆亲锄。\n承世不出力，冬竹肯抽葅。\n外物莫相诱，约心誓从初。\n碧芳既似水，日日咏归欤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}